{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Player": 8,
    "Soraya": 38
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7182201",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Soraya",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "718220101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "718220101": {
            "id": "718220101",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Mt. Tianheng... Skybracer... Hmm...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718220102"
            ]
          },
          "718220102": {
            "id": "718220102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What are you thinking about?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718220103"
            ]
          },
          "718220103": {
            "id": "718220103",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Ah, I'm currently researching the history and legends of Lantern Rite.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718220104"
            ]
          },
          "718220104": {
            "id": "718220104",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "I've heard that this year's Mingxiao Lantern is modeled after an adeptus named Skybracer.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718220105"
            ]
          },
          "718220105": {
            "id": "718220105",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "From what legends I've been able to gather, this adeptus also fought alongside Rex Lapis for a time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718220106"
            ]
          },
          "718220106": {
            "id": "718220106",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "The exact times and the enemies they faced have differed from text to ancient text...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718220107"
            ]
          },
          "718220107": {
            "id": "718220107",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "But all the sources concur that Skybracer has already passed on, and it has been stated that this adeptus once held Mt. Tianheng up with their own antlers.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718220108"
            ]
          },
          "718220108": {
            "id": "718220108",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "That's why I came to Mt. Tianheng to see for myself, thinking that if I got lucky, I might find something...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718220109"
            ]
          },
          "718220109": {
            "id": "718220109",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "But as it turns out, Mt. Tianheng is crawling with monsters. After ascertaining the site for my investigations, I found it to be so full of monsters as to be impassable...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718220110"
            ]
          },
          "718220110": {
            "id": "718220110",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Traveler, if you're willing, could you help me investigate and take some soil samples?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718220111"
            ]
          },
          "718220111": {
            "id": "718220111",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Soil... samples?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718220112"
            ]
          },
          "718220112": {
            "id": "718220112",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Well, that's what we'd say at the Akademiya, but what we really mean is some soil from the area in question.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718220113"
            ]
          },
          "718220113": {
            "id": "718220113",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Local legends hold that Skybracer held Mt. Tianheng up with their own antlers...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718220114"
            ]
          },
          "718220114": {
            "id": "718220114",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "From an academic perspective, it stands to reason that the ground here might have an unusual composition.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718220115"
            ]
          },
          "718220115": {
            "id": "718220115",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "So please, help me go there and retrieve a soil sample."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7182202",
      "subQuestName": "Retrieve the Soil Sample",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "718220201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "718220201": {
            "id": "718220201",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Antlers... Mt. Tianheng... Hmm, if this is real..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7182203",
      "subQuestName": "Report back to Soraya",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "718220301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "718220301": {
            "id": "718220301",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Have you brought the sample back with you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718220302"
            ]
          },
          "718220302": {
            "id": "718220302",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I've brought it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718220303"
            ]
          },
          "718220303": {
            "id": "718220303",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Thank you very much. Let me have a look.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718220304"
            ]
          },
          "718220304": {
            "id": "718220304",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "...Hmm, there seems to be nothing special about the soil here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718220305"
            ]
          },
          "718220305": {
            "id": "718220305",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What were you hoping to find?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718220306"
            ]
          },
          "718220306": {
            "id": "718220306",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "The legends say that Skybracer used their strong antlers to protect Liyue Harbor by preventing Mt. Tianheng from collapsing.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718220307"
            ]
          },
          "718220307": {
            "id": "718220307",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "I thought that I could at least find some fragments of those antlers...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718220308"
            ]
          },
          "718220308": {
            "id": "718220308",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "As I thought, legends are just that, legends... Or has so much time passed since that battle that all traces of it have long since vanished?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718220309"
            ]
          },
          "718220309": {
            "id": "718220309",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Still, getting a soil sample is, in and of itself, not a bad result...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718220310"
            ]
          },
          "718220310": {
            "id": "718220310",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Traveler, could you accompany me for a while longer? I'd like to head upwards, it shouldn't be too far.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718220313"
            ]
          },
          "718220313": {
            "id": "718220313",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "This time... I want to get to a vantage point from which I can overlook Mt. Tianheng and study its terrain.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718220314"
            ]
          },
          "718220314": {
            "id": "718220314",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "The tales say that Rex Lapis and many adepti took part in that battle, and very nearly caused Mt. Tianheng to collapse.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718220315"
            ]
          },
          "718220315": {
            "id": "718220315",
            "speakerId": 2211,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "If the battle truly was that fierce, then perhaps we might be able to deduce something from the terrain."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7182204",
